  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n20% of k = 10 less than 1200% of 10\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n20% of k = 1200% of 10 - 10\n\n⇒ (20/100) × k = (1200/100) × 10 - 10\n\n⇒ (20/100) × k = 120 - 10\n\n⇒ (20/100) × k = 110\n\n⇒ k = (110 × 100) / 20\n\n⇒ k = 550\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**",
